:{"doc":"The index of the first element at or after `start` that satisfies `p`, with a proof that it is in\nbounds.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Float64/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array.findFinIdx?","kind":"def","line":108,"name":"ScalarArray.Float64Array.findFinIdx?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/Float64/Array.lean#L108-L120"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array.propagateMark\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float64Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">propagateMark</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array\">Float64Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array\">Float64Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array\">Float64Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `b`, marked as linear if `a` is marked. Like `markLinear`, marking copies `b` first if it is\nshared. Logically this is `b`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Float64/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array.propagateMark","kind":"def","line":99,"name":"ScalarArray.Float64Array.propagateMark","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/Float64/Array.lean#L99-L104"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array.markLinear\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float64Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">markLinear</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array\">Float64Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array\">Float64Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Marks `a` as linear, a debugging aid: if a marked array is ever copied because it is shared when\nit needs to be exclusive, as before an in-place write, the runtime panics. The mark goes on an\nexclusive array, so if `a` is shared it is copied first and the copy is marked. Logically this is\nthe identity.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Float64/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array.markLinear","kind":"def","line":90,"name":"ScalarArray.Float64Array.markLinear","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/87420c7a871cc979ee4f3e09b232da6acc8abe86/ScalarArray/Float64/Array.lean#L90-L97"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Array.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array.extract\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float64Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">extract</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array\">Float64Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">start </span><span class=\"fn\">stop</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Float64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Float64Array\">Float64Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The elements of `a` from index `start` up to, but not including, `min stop a.size`, copied into a\nnew array.","docLi